ously made E-4 Trop variant except that it had an option 300 L drop tank.","LocalizedString":"The Messerschmitt Bf 109 was one of the main German fighter aircraft during WWII. A total of 33,984 aircraft were produced from 1937 to 1945 and the BF 109E-7 Trop was one of many variants made. Apart from the tropical color scheme a number of modifications were made to the standard Bf 109 in order to make it suitable for tropical climates and the desert sand. The E-7 was very similar to the previously made E-4 Trop variant except that it had an option 300 L drop tank."},"operationCost":2,"rarity":"ERarityEnum::Common","cardSet":"ECardSetEnum::Legions","isInPermanentPool":true,"extraHelpTextBubbleTypes":["EHelpBubbleTypes::Deployment"],"draftBaseWeight":0.9,"hasDeployment":true,"soundBlowUp":{"ObjectName":"SoundCue'AU_Exp_Aircraft_Medium_Cue'","ObjectPath":"kards/Content/Assets/Audio/Card_Blowups/AU_Exp_Aircraft_Medium_Cue.0"},"Image":{"AssetPathName":"/Game/Assets/Textures/Images/Germany/Invasion/t_me_109_2_512px.t_me_109_2_512px","SubPathString":""},"artist":"Jarosław Wróbel","historyPhoto":{"AssetPathName":"/Game/Assets/Textures/HistoricalPhotos/BF_109E-7_TROP.BF_109E-7_TROP","SubPathString":""},"historyPhotoSize":{"X":512.0,"Y":297.0},"historyPhotoDescription":{"Namespace":"card_germany","Key":"card_unit_me_bf_109_v2_photo","SourceString":"Bf 109E-7 Trop and a Stuka, date unknown.","LocalizedString":"Bf 109E-7 Trop and a Stuka, date unknown."},"blowUpExplosion":{"ObjectName":"ParticleSystem'P_ExplosionAircraftM'","ObjectPath":"kards/Content/Effects/Explosions/Medium/Aircraft/P_ExplosionAircraftM.193"},"blowUpCameraShake":{"ObjectName":"BlueprintGeneratedClass'CameraShakeMedium_C'","ObjectPath":"kards/Content/examples/GrenadePack/Blueprints/CameraShakeMedium.0"},"OnAttackVisualsSoft":{"AssetPathName":"/Game/Blueprints/Effects/BP_AttackFighter.BP_AttackFighter_C","SubPathString":""}},"variables":[{"name":"infantryFound","type":"bool","direction":"in"},{"name":"tankFound",